"use strict";(self.webpackChunk_N_E=self.webpackChunk_N_E||[]).push([[99283],{99283:function(e){e.exports=JSON.parse('{"content":"\\n<center>\\n<BookCard \\n          cover=\\"/assets/snippets/books/behind-doors.png\\"\\n          title=\\"Behind Closed Doors\\"\\n          author=\\"B. A. Paris\\"\\n          publisher=\\"Momo\\"\\n          publishedDate=\\"2021-12-06\\"\\n          isbn=\\"9791191043525\\"\\n          rating=3.5\\n          tags=\\"thriller\\"\\n        />\\n</center>\\n\\n## Review\\nThe desperate emotions and fear of the female protagonist are felt intact.  \\nI felt frustrated throughout reading the book. Does it feel like being caught in a trap from which you cannot escape?  \\n<br>\\nThere must be many similar cases in the world we don\'t know about. No, there certainly are. It\'s just that we don\'t recognize them until an incident breaks out.  \\n<br>\\nBut I wonder if I would have the courage to help even if someone were in such a situation.\\n"}')}}]);